{"id": "0007915_p0001", "tianyige_id": "0007915", "title": "嘉靖二十八年江南武舉鄉試錄", "western_year": 1549, "reign_era": "嘉靖", "reign_year": 28, "exam_level": "provincial (鄉試)", "military": true, "province": "江南", "province_en": "Jiangnan", "page": 1, "scan_url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?title=File%3ATianyige-330000-1705-0007915_%E5%98%89%E9%9D%96%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AB%E5%B9%B4%E6%B1%9F%E5%8D%97%E6%AD%A6%E8%88%89%E9%84%89%E8%A9%A6%E9%8C%84_%E6%98%8E%E5%98%89%E9%9D%96%E5%88%BB%E6%9C%AC.pdf&page=1", "text": "江南武舉鄉試錄序\n維歲己酉\n侍御史張公奉\n命按茲南土以十月己酉檄六郡之\n士及良家子諳韜畧者命有司\n致禮幣聘駿及推官王子鳴臣\n典試事三試之汰者什七而存\n===\n者三錄其姓氏而上之司馬氏\n事竣駿乃以語言諭衆曰盖聞\n古者男子生三日父母祿持之\n桑弧蓬矢以射祝之曰願其有\n事於天地四方毋徒齷齪守向\n舍爲也自今觀之桑弧蓬矢之\n當於郊廟朝廷之用而無", "banxin": ["武舉錄序 一"], "ocr_model": "claude-opus-5-5 (agy, low effort)", "blank": false, "has_examiner_comments": false, "chatter_stripped": false, "alt_text": null, "alt_ocr_model": null, "agreement": null, "punctuated": null, "translation_en": null, "translation_model": null}
